# B970 (#288): SHA256 pins for the third-party archives the ARM image builds from.
# They live on NFS in $VENDOR_STORE (default /mnt/projects/fable/ci-arm/vendor/), never in git;
# scripts/ci/vendor_fetch.sh --ensure verifies them against this file and fetches any that
# are missing. Same format as sha256sum -c. Hashes are of the files the Dockerfile used to
# wget from downloads.sourceforge.net (re-downloaded and compared 2026-10-01).
